 *  --------+----+---+---+---+-...-+-----+
 *
 *  ----------------------------------+--------------------------------------
 *  Landscape Display:                | Reverse Landscape Display:
 *  --------+----------------------+  |  --------+--------------------------+
 *          |       Column         |  |          |         Column           |
 *  --------+---+---+---+-..-+-----+  |  --------+-----+-----+-----+-..-+---+
 *  Page 0  | 0 | 1 | 2 |    | 127 |  |  Page 7  | 127 | 126 | 125 |    | 0 |
 *  --------+---+---+---+-..-+-----+  |  --------+-----+-----+-----+-..-+---+
 *  Page 1  | V                    |  |  Page 6  |                        ^ |
 *  --------+---+---+---+-..-+-----+  |  --------+-----+-----+-----+-..-+---+
